Andročec, Darko, ‘Analysis of Sci-Hub Downloads of Computer Science Papers’, Acta Universitatis Sapientiae, &lt;em&gt;Informatica&lt;/em&gt;, 9.1 (2017), pp. 83–96, &lt;a href=&quot;https://doi.org/10.1515/ausi-2017-0006&quot;&gt;https://doi.org/10.1515/ausi-2017-0006&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
