 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;anitem genericitem&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;prefix&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;bibitem&quot;&gt;  &lt;a href=&quot;https://eprints.bbk.ac.uk/id/eprint/40856&quot; class=&quot;csl-entry&quot;&gt;Eve, Martin Paul, ‘Open Access in the Humanities Disciplines’, in &lt;i&gt;The Bloomsbury Handbook of Digital Humanities&lt;/i&gt;, ed. by James O’Sullivan (Bloomsbury, 2022)&lt;/a&gt;
