    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://direct.mit.edu/books/book/4933/chapter/625176/Toward-Linked-Open-Data-for-Latin-America&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot;&gt;Toward Linked Open Data for Latin America&lt;/a&gt; – Arianna Becerril-García and Eduardo Aguado-López&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://direct.mit.edu/books/book/4933/chapter/625177/The-Pasts-Presents-and-Futures-of-SciELO&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot;&gt;The Pasts, Presents, and Futures of SciELO&lt;/a&gt; – Abel L. Packer&lt;/li&gt;
