&lt;p&gt;RM: We’re doing lots of work on the signals re. what researchers are doing and building it out.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;JJ: Competitors?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;RM: Thomson Reuters.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;[THIS PORTION WITHHELD UNDER SECTION 43 OF THE INFORMATION ACT: COMMECIALLY SENSITIVE]&lt;/p&gt;

