&lt;li&gt;Koh, Adeline, &lt;a href=&quot;http://eprints.lincoln.ac.uk/view/creators/3354.html&quot;&gt;Eve, Martin Paul&lt;/a&gt;, &quot;&lt;a href=&quot;http://eprints.lincoln.ac.uk/id/eprint/14025&quot;&gt;A Public Library of the Humanities? An interview with Martin Paul Eve&lt;/a&gt;&quot;, &lt;i&gt;Chronicle of Higher Education&lt;/i&gt;, 2014&lt;/li&gt;
