&lt;span class=&quot;nt&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;subtitle&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;A Plugin&lt;span class=&quot;nt&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;/subtitle&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;nt&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;abstract&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;It has long been desirable to create PDF files from a standard XML base. This plugin allows that to happen using a combination of OJS, Saxon and FOP.&lt;span class=&quot;nt&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;/abstract&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
