&lt;p&gt;As is clear, the latter, authentic site is running on it&apos;s own independent IP address, while the former points to the commercial web host provider Dreamhost.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Secondly, here&apos;s a comparison of the DNS whois responses for the two domains. Firstly, for the fake entry:&lt;/p&gt;
