Dr. Simon de Bourcier, University of East Anglia&lt;br /&gt;
Professor David Cowart, University of South Carolina&lt;br /&gt;
Professor Luc Herman, University of Antwerp&lt;br /&gt;
Dr. Zofia Kolbuszewska, University of Lublin&lt;br /&gt;
Dr. Sascha Pöhlmann, University of Munich&lt;br /&gt;
Dr. Jeff Severs, University of British Columbia&lt;br /&gt;
Dr. Birger Vanwesenbeeck, SUNY Fredonia&lt;/p&gt;


